        <div><a name="_chinese" id="_chinese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.8 Chinese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9350a909-548f-409a-a5a0-5afea60982c3" id="_9350a909-548f-409a-a5a0-5afea60982c3"></a>Chinese personal names are names used by those from mainland China, Hong Kong,
Macau, Taiwan, and the Chinese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1d3ec8a7-ff99-4823-afb9-8891f9888d4d" id="_1d3ec8a7-ff99-4823-afb9-8891f9888d4d"></a>Chinese names consist of a
family name (&#x59D3;, x&#xEC;ng), followed by
a given name (&#x540D;, m&#xED;ng).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8cebe5df-c06b-46ce-8303-06735d2de9d4" id="_8cebe5df-c06b-46ce-8303-06735d2de9d4"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0ed3f193-a7ee-406b-bc5d-636d98dab39d" id="_0ed3f193-a7ee-406b-bc5d-636d98dab39d"></a>Some people also utilize a &#x201C;courtesy name&#x201D; or &#x201C;style name&#x201D; (&#x5B57;, z&#xEC;),
by which they were known among those outside their
family and closest friends.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_representations" id="_typical_name_representations"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.8.1 Typical name representations</p><div class="example"><a name="_97a13c60-53a3-4e42-8cf3-c49da5ccd4f2" id="_97a13c60-53a3-4e42-8cf3-c49da5ccd4f2"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x6587;&#x201D; (Sun Man), the birth name of the founding father
of the Republic of China &#x201C;Sun Yat-sen&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.1</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_77391abf-baf3-47ae-b2f7-3cdc3aafe792" id="_77391abf-baf3-47ae-b2f7-3cdc3aafe792"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x6587;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_47dc308e-ea88-462b-97f6-d3b0ca54749d" id="_47dc308e-ea88-462b-97f6-d3b0ca54749d"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x5FB7;&#x660E;&#x201D; (Sun De Ming), the genealogical name (&#x8B5C;&#x540D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.2</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_42275514-7dfa-4173-8455-6a60a95fc4b2" id="_42275514-7dfa-4173-8455-6a60a95fc4b2"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5FB7;&#x660E;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
