        <div><a name="_manchu" id="_manchu"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.30 Manchu</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_58044df3-7ed4-421b-8aed-875496bcf09e" id="_58044df3-7ed4-421b-8aed-875496bcf09e"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo32;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo32;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0524a885-80b0-4728-aa3e-71096ea788a3" id="_0524a885-80b0-4728-aa3e-71096ea788a3"></a>Manchus are called only by their given names.
Manchu clan names (&#x201C;hala&#x201D;) are not used with their personal names,
but occasionally a family name is used.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_10" id="_typical_name_patterns_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.30.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.40</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_9f5cdac2-fb41-4f7e-b562-59ba5bc6d8a0" id="_9f5cdac2-fb41-4f7e-b562-59ba5bc6d8a0"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.41</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_f055482f-8bdd-4ed9-9f9e-a3b76bd541f3" id="_f055482f-8bdd-4ed9-9f9e-a3b76bd541f3"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.42</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_b02238c5-10cc-455a-96fe-fbff8bb3793b" id="_b02238c5-10cc-455a-96fe-fbff8bb3793b"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_10" id="_examples_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.30.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_4536390d-3cb9-4fb0-b26c-3d2583e73a5f" id="_4536390d-3cb9-4fb0-b26c-3d2583e73a5f"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Tuli&#x161;en&#x201D;</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_35ce0594-e082-4d15-8d95-5411394b5da0" id="_35ce0594-e082-4d15-8d95-5411394b5da0"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Hiowan Ye&#x201D; (&#x7384;&#x70E8;)</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_731a9950-1971-4c12-8b57-5cb2deedfc01" id="_731a9950-1971-4c12-8b57-5cb2deedfc01"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  3</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Aisin-Gioro Ulhicun&#x201D;, linguist. The family name is &#x201C;Aisin-Gioro&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
        <div><a name="_mongolian" id="_mongolian"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.31 Mongolian</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_121adbd6-d725-47a4-8a7c-bfbc34f22688" id="_121adbd6-d725-47a4-8a7c-bfbc34f22688"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo33;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo33;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    clan name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo33;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo33;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    genonymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_168247dd-e6de-4dce-b3ce-4cf8cf1b28d8" id="_168247dd-e6de-4dce-b3ce-4cf8cf1b28d8"></a>Mongolian names traditionally consists of only one personal name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_11" id="_typical_name_patterns_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.31.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.43</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_2cbce7e9-6a7d-4ae8-8f09-cd4b6ee470c4" id="_2cbce7e9-6a7d-4ae8-8f09-cd4b6ee470c4"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">clan name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.44</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_96b63ff7-fb33-4a80-a697-73eacefcad48" id="_96b63ff7-fb33-4a80-a697-73eacefcad48"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
