  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6da48449-f852-4eb7-9818-f7ec9ec7b1be" id="_6da48449-f852-4eb7-9818-f7ec9ec7b1be"></a>Portuguese often have two personal names, although the first may at times be used on its own.</p>
