        <div><a name="_thai" id="_thai"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.45 Thai</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_79366132-cee2-4013-9fb8-3a2e71ab2b85" id="_79366132-cee2-4013-9fb8-3a2e71ab2b85"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fb518b98-7d27-4e1f-ab49-da724ef8f21d" id="_fb518b98-7d27-4e1f-ab49-da724ef8f21d"></a>Modern Thai names are composed of given names followed by the family name.
Prior to 1913, family names were not required.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_15" id="_typical_name_patterns_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.45.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.49</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_0760909c-7e9f-43da-8239-a5d0cf78fee3" id="_0760909c-7e9f-43da-8239-a5d0cf78fee3"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.50</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_0ca47d34-5485-4e39-b45e-20534cbc76c3" id="_0ca47d34-5485-4e39-b45e-20534cbc76c3"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_15" id="_examples_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.45.2 Examples</p>

  <div class="example"><a name="_588251d0-6477-49f9-a284-e4649fca7044" id="_588251d0-6477-49f9-a284-e4649fca7044"></a><p class="example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#xE0A;&#xE27;&#xE19; &#xE2B;&#xE25;&#xE35;&#xE01;&#xE20;&#xE31;&#xE22; (&#x201C;Chuan Likphai&#x201D;)</p></div>
</div></div>
        <div><a name="_turkish" id="_turkish"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.46 Turkish</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_ukrainian" id="_ukrainian"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.47 Ukrainian</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_vietnamese" id="_vietnamese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.48 Vietnamese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9cc9bbd4-5601-4526-a2b5-fe0fb2bb5446" id="_9cc9bbd4-5601-4526-a2b5-fe0fb2bb5446"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    additional name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo38;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    family name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fb5bd972-2d85-4944-9a9c-85b17fcb96c8" id="_fb5bd972-2d85-4944-9a9c-85b17fcb96c8"></a>Vietnamese personal names are names used by those from Vietnam and the
Vietnamese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f2a94487-5723-4e13-b1af-7df685fb3a52" id="_f2a94487-5723-4e13-b1af-7df685fb3a52"></a>Vietnamese names consist of a family name (T&#xEA;n, &#x20E1B;),
followed by a given name (H&#x1ECD;, /&#x22A5C;).
Between the family name and given name,
one or more additional names may be present.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f986431a-962d-45de-bd6d-0bc0e2522a00" id="_f986431a-962d-45de-bd6d-0bc0e2522a00"></a>Vietnamese additional names can be a
middle name (t&#xEA;n &#x111;&#x1EC7;m),
generational name,
or clan distinguisher name. The middle name, for identification purposes, can be omitted.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7dbff57d-f6e1-49e1-8aaf-d4a633f39d0b" id="_7dbff57d-f6e1-49e1-8aaf-d4a633f39d0b"></a>Courtesy names are also allowed, separate from the given name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_16" id="_typical_name_patterns_16"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.48.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.51</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_14c7ea6c-ca79-4b15-b0d9-73d7279347e7" id="_14c7ea6c-ca79-4b15-b0d9-73d7279347e7"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.52</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_bc0756b9-ab1a-4a7e-9e8f-1183ab90a42e" id="_bc0756b9-ab1a-4a7e-9e8f-1183ab90a42e"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table C.53</p><div align="center"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" summary=""><a name="_d206b028-3e14-400e-91a8-3e1dba583e05" id="_d206b028-3e14-400e-91a8-3e1dba583e05"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">additonal name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
