        <h1 class="Section3">Bibliography</h1>
        <p class="Biblio"><a name="ISO639-3" id="ISO639-3"></a>[1]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO 639-3, <i>Codes for the representation of names of languages &#x2013; Part 3: Alpha-3 code for comprehensive coverage of languages</i></p>
