        <p class="Biblio"><a name="ISO12234-3" id="ISO12234-3"></a>[6]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO 12234-3:2016, <i>Electronic still picture imaging &#x2013; Removable memory &#x2013; Part 3: XMP for digital photography</i></p>
        <p class="Biblio"><a name="ISO14105" id="ISO14105"></a>[7]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO/TR 14105:2011, <i>Document management &#x2013; Change management for successful electronic document management system (EDMS) implementation</i></p>
        <p class="Biblio"><a name="ISO14198" id="ISO14198"></a>[8]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO/TS 14198:2012, <i>Road vehicles &#x2013; Ergonomic aspects of transport information and control systems &#x2013; Calibration tasks for methods which assess driver demand due to the use of in-vehicle systems</i></p>
