        <p class="Biblio"><a name="iso15924" id="iso15924"></a>[10]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO 15924:2004, <i>Information and documentation &#x2013; Codes for the representation of names of scripts</i></p>
        <p class="Biblio"><a name="ISO15961" id="ISO15961"></a>[11]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO/IEC 15961:2004, <i>Information technology &#x2013; Radio frequency identification (RFID) for item management &#x2013; Data protocol: application interface</i></p>
